sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Reviewer
    participant API as FastAPI Service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant BG as Background Job

    U->>API: POST /review
    API->>DB: Insert review action
    API->>DB: Update assessment status if approved or rejected
    U->>API: POST /rerun with instruction
    API->>DB: Create new assessment_version with parent_version_id
    API->>BG: Reuse stored PDFs and rerun assessment
    BG->>DB: Write new version outputs
    API-->>U: Return new version_id
